        <h2>Rental Ending Soon ⏳</h2>

        <p>Hello {{name}},</p>

        <p>Just a friendly reminder that your rental for order <strong>#{{rentalNumber}}</strong> is coming to an end.</p>

        <div class="info-box">
            <strong>Return Date: {{returnDate}}</strong><br>
            <span>{{daysLeft}} day(s) remaining</span>
        </div>

        <p>What would you like to do?</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Return the product</strong> — schedule a pickup at your convenience</li>
            <li><strong>Extend your rental</strong> — continue enjoying the product for a few more months</li>
            <li><strong>Buy it</strong> — check with the vendor about purchasing options</li>
        </ul>

        <center>
            <a href="{{manageUrl}}" class="button">Manage My Rental</a>
        </center>

        <p>If you have any questions, just reply to this email or contact support.</p>

        <p>Thank you for renting with RentEase!</p>

        <p>Best Regards,<br>The RentEase Team</p>
